### FinSight v2 - Manual Verification Postman / HTTP Client Checklist
### Run these sequentially against the running Spring Boot application (localhost:8080)

### 1. Register Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Employee Tester",
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login as Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
> {% client.global.set("employee_token", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 3. Login as Manager (Assuming seed data created manager@example.com)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
> {% client.global.set("manager_token", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 4. Login as Finance Admin (Assuming seed data created finance_admin@example.com)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "finance_admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
> {% client.global.set("finance_token", response.body.data.accessToken); %}


### 5. Employee Create Expense (Idempotency check)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{employee_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idem-key-001

{
  "amount": 150.00,
  "category": "OFFICE_SUPPLIES",
  "expenseDate": "2026-08-18",
  "description": "Purchased pens"
}

### 6. Employee Submit Expense
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{employee_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. Manager List Team Expenses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/team?status=PENDING_APPROVAL
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### 8. Manager Approve Expense
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Finance Admin Process Expense
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1/process
Authorization: Bearer {{finance_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10. Finance Admin Creates Budget
POST http://localhost:8080/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{finance_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "OFFICE_SUPPLIES",
  "monthYear": "2026-08",
  "limit": 1000.00
}

### 11. Finance Admin Dashboard Analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboards/summary?startDate=2026-08-01&endDate=2026-09-01
Authorization: Bearer {{finance_token}}

### 12. Finance Admin Request Report
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/expense-summary?period=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{finance_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Finance Admin Check Audit Logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{finance_token}}
